  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>{{ page.title | escape }}</title>
    <meta name="description" content="{{ page.description | escape }}">
    <meta property="og:title" content="{{ page.title | escape }}">
    <meta property="og:description" content="{{ page.description | escape }}">
    <meta property="og:type" content="article">
    <meta property="og:image" content="{{ '/assets/blog/gepa-curator/curator-overview.png' | absolute_url }}">
    <link rel="canonical" href="{{ page.url | absolute_url }}">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ '/assets/blog/gepa-curator/project.css' | relative_url }}">
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <header class="project-nav">
      <nav aria-label="Project navigation">
        <a class="home-link" href="{{ '/' | relative_url }}">← Zack Yu</a>
        <div class="section-links">
          <a href="#overview">Overview</a>
          <a href="#gepa-curator">Method</a>
          <a href="#results">Results</a>
          <a href="#why-does-curation-work">Analysis</a>
          <a href="#try-it-on-an-existing-gepa-run">Code</a>
          <a href="#citation">Cite</a>
        </div>
      </nav>
    </header>
    <main id="main">
      <section class="project-hero" aria-labelledby="project-title">
        <h1 id="project-title">GEPA<span>-Curator</span></h1>
        <p class="project-subtitle">Curated Learning for Self Improving Agents</p>
        <div class="project-authors">{{ page.project_authors | markdownify }}</div>
        <p class="contributions">* Equal contribution &nbsp; · &nbsp; ** Equal advising</p>
        <div class="resource-links" aria-label="Project resources">
          <a class="primary" href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.37651v1">Read the paper <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a href="https://github.com/gepa-ai/gepa/pull/560">Code &amp; integration <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a href="#overview">Watch overview <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="project-overview" id="overview" aria-labelledby="overview-title">
        <p class="eyebrow">The idea in brief</p>
        <h2 id="overview-title">
          Better learning starts with<br>
          better experiences.
        </h2>
        <p class="lead">
          A failed rollout is not always a prompt weakness. GEPA-Curator chooses which tasks are worth learning from and retrieves past successes to
          help the optimizer understand what went wrong.
        </p>
        <figure class="overview-video">
          <video
            controls
            playsinline
            preload="metadata"
            poster="{{ '/assets/blog/gepa-curator/curator-overview.png' | relative_url }}"
            aria-label="GEPA-Curator project overview"
          >
            <source src="{{ '/assets/blog/gepa-curator/gepa-curator.mp4' | relative_url }}" type="video/mp4">
            <a href="{{ '/assets/blog/gepa-curator/gepa-curator.mp4' | relative_url }}">Download the overview video</a>.
          </video>
          <figcaption>GEPA-Curator: task curation and prior success retrieval for reflective optimization.</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <div class="mechanisms">
          <div>
            <span class="mechanism-number">01</span>
            <h3>Choose what to learn from</h3>
            <p>Read each task’s history to decide whether another rollout can provide useful signal.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="mechanism-number">02</span>
            <h3>Learn from what worked</h3>
            <p>Give the reflector a trusted success from the same task as a reference for diagnosing a failure.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <article class="project-content" aria-label="Research details">{{ content }}</article>
      <section class="citation" id="citation" aria-labelledby="citation-title">
        <p class="eyebrow">Reference</p>
        <h2 id="citation-title">Cite this work</h2>
        <pre><code>{% raw %}@misc{yu2026gepacurator,
  title         = {{GEPA-Curator}: Curated Learning for Self Improving Agents},
  author        = {Yu, Zack and Lee, Nicholas and Lee, Minjae and
                   Agarwal, Lakshya and Manolache, Luca and Kang, Wonjun and
                   Zaharia, Matei and Mahoney, Michael W. and Keutzer, Kurt and
                   Kim, Sehoon and Gholami, Amir},
  year          = {2026},
  eprint        = {2610.37651},
  archivePrefix = {arXiv},
  primaryClass  = {cs.CL},
  doi           = {10.48550/arXiv.2610.37651},
  url           = {https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.37651}
}{% endraw %}</code></pre>
      </section>
    </main>
    <footer class="project-footer">
      <a href="#project-title">GEPA-Curator ↑</a><a href="{{ '/' | relative_url }}">Zack Yu</a><a href="{{ '/blog/' | relative_url }}">All posts</a>
